@startuml
!theme plain
title OldShop Day 5 - Transactional outbox ETL (one host)
actor User
rectangle "FastAPI\nPG transactions use UTC" as api
database "PG primary\ntransactional source" as pg
database "etl_time_origin\nlegacy: Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh\nnew: session timezone" as origins
queue "etl_outbox\nID/key/op only\npending / dead / done" as outbox
rectangle "etl-worker\nSingle session advisory lock\nfull then incremental every 60s" as worker
rectangle "Extract\nREPEATABLE READ\ncolumn allowlists" as extract
rectangle "Transform\nexact VND / aware UTC\nstrict schema / safe text" as transform
rectangle "Load\npartial upsert by source key\npreserve Mongo-owned fields" as load
database "Mongo\n6 projections + etl_errors" as mongo
storage "MinIO\nprivate buckets" as minio
database "PG report_daily_sales\nVN business day\ngross delivered items" as report
database "PG etl_runs / etl_state\ncounts, errors, backlog, heartbeat" as runs
User --> api
api --> pg : transactional writes
pg --> outbox : I/U/D triggers, same transaction
pg --> origins : timestamp provenance
outbox --> worker : unacknowledged due events\nno MAX(id) cursor
worker --> extract
pg --> extract
origins --> extract
extract --> transform
transform --> load
load --> mongo : majority write
load --> minio : copy exact referenced local key if missing
worker --> outbox : ACK exact event after successful writes
worker --> report : atomic rebuild
worker --> runs
worker --> mongo : sanitized errors, retry/backoff
worker --> pg : daily reconciliation
note bottom of pg
No source timestamp rewrite.
Stock/balance decisions remain in PG.
Outbox enabled before the full snapshot.
Concurrent source changes stay queued.
end note
note bottom of mongo
attributes/tags, review moderation/evidence,
contact attachments survive full load/replay.
Crash before ACK -> replay (at least once).
Log copy TTL 90d; PG logs are not purged.
end note
@enduml
